WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,480
You said you were looking for Mr. Zui?

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:03,880
What good person uses his little finger as a fingerprint?

3
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:05,080
I have to wipe your ass

4
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:10,430
You just kidnapped my son, young boy

5
00:00:10,430 --> 00:00:11,830
My name is Chen Haoyu

6
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:13,790
You are the sword master

7
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:18,540
I want to use my son to threaten Jiandao to retreat.

8
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:21,380
After all, I still can’t calm down anymore.

9
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:23,680
He kidnapped my son but didn’t dare to kill him

10
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:26,080
Want to negotiate with me but are afraid of angering me

11
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:28,280
So you have been discussing it for so many days

12
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:31,080
Have you thought about the terms for negotiating with me?

13
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:32,800
Let me go

14
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:33,800
Jiandao within one month

15
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,400
I won’t use troops against Longmu City to give you time to prepare.

16
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,920
But the person who kidnapped my son

17
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:41,050
Must come to see death

18
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:42,660
rather than discuss

19
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:43,860
is an order

20
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:45,910
I am the one who died for you

21
00:00:45,910 --> 00:00:48,220
Clear

22
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:50,020
No chickens or dogs left in Longmu City
